		COMPLIMENTS RECEIVED, MAY 1996

		May 2   Receptionist: "Nice tie."
		May 9   Waiter at the club: "Very good, sir." (counts)
		May 14  Mother: "You look tired." (does NOT count)
		May 21  Lars at work: "Fancy."
		May 28  Stranger on the bus: "Wow." (the tie? me? both.)

		Total: 4. Target for June: 10.

