	icon: res://win95/theme/icons/document_text_32.png
	modified: Wednesday, May 29, 1996 11:40:02 PM
	contents:
		SPEECH, CLUB DINNER, JUNE 14

		Gentlemen.

		They say a man is judged by the company he keeps.
		Look around you. We are excellent company.

		(pause for applause)
		(adjust tie)

